         <Iptc4xmpCore:AltTextAccessibility>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Circle of Health image. Large light blue outer circle that reads â€œCommunity.â€ Inside that circle is a dark blue circle that reads â€œPrevention &amp; Treatmentâ€ on the left and â€œConventional &amp; Complementary Approachesâ€ on the right. Inside of that is a bright green circle, which holds eight smaller white circles that read clockwise from the top: â€œMoving the Bodyâ€”Energy &amp; Flexibility;â€ â€œSurroundingsâ€”Physical &amp; Emotional;â€ â€œPersonal Developmentâ€”Personal Life &amp; Work Life;â€ â€œFood &amp; Drinkâ€” Nourishing &amp; Fueling;â€ â€œRechargeâ€”Sleep &amp; Refresh;â€ â€œFamily, Friends &amp; Co-workersâ€”Relationships;â€ â€œSpirit &amp; Soulâ€”Growing &amp; Connecting;â€ â€œPower of the Mindâ€”Relaxing &amp; Healing.â€ At the center of this graphic is a small blue circle that reads â€œMe,â€ with the word â€œMindfulâ€ above it and â€œAwarenessâ€ below it.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </Iptc4xmpCore:AltTextAccessibility>
