            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Infographic of things you can do with a counselor in the PCPG program. Through a personalized session with a counselor, you can: Market yourself; Evaluate your skills and strengths; Find a training or academic program; Identify jobs that align with your interests and skills; Develop a detailed action plan; and Research your local labor market.</rdf:li>
